DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
25221::$$$message_0184_0000_0000$$$::  I had[wait canskip=0 time=400] a completely disconnected [wait canskip=0 time=400]dream.::
25222::$$$message_0184_0001_0000$$$::"...Ngh..."[lr]::
25223::$$$message_0184_0001_0001$$$::I have a migraine. Maybe it's because of my irregular sleep schedule.[lr]::
25224::$$$message_0184_0001_0002$$$::It's not yet 6:00 AM.[lr]::
25225::$$$message_0184_0001_0003$$$::The sunlight is somewhat strong through my window, and the air seeping through the cracks is somewhat cold.::
25226::$$$message_0184_0002_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
25227::$$$message_0184_0002_0001$$$::There's another Holy Grail War happening at night.[lr]::
25228::$$$message_0184_0002_0002$$$::A Fuyuki that ends on the fourth day.[lr]::
25229::$$$message_0184_0002_0003$$$::A visitor that didn't exist before.[lr]::
25230::$$$message_0184_0002_0004$$$::Incoherent words go through my head, disappearing without a trace.[lr]::
25231::$$$message_0184_0002_0005$$$::I don't remember seeing or hearing them, but the runner next to me insists that they're fiction, and that they're real.::
25232::$$$message_0184_0003_0000$$$::"Okay, better go make breakfast."[lr]::
25233::$$$message_0184_0003_0001$$$::I shake off the delusions.[lr]::
25234::$$$message_0184_0003_0002$$$::The dream I had today was of getting ready for the cultural festival.[lr]::
25235::$$$message_0184_0003_0003$$$::It wasn't a strange dream at all.[lr]::
25236::$$$message_0184_0003_0004$$$::The weather is clear and pleasant.[lr]::
25237::$$$message_0184_0003_0005$$$::I'll just spend my time taking it easy in one of the empty rooms.::
25238::$$$message_0184_0004_0000$$$::"I'm heading out![lr]::
25239::$$$message_0184_0004_0001$$$::Shirou, Sakura, don't be late!"::
25240::$$$message_0184_0005_0000$$$::Fuji-nee races off to work.[lr]::
25241::$$$message_0184_0005_0001$$$::It's past 7:00 AM.[lr]::
25242::$$$message_0184_0005_0002$$$::The mood around the dining table becomes more relaxing after Fuji-nee leaves, but today, someone brings up an ominous topic.[wm canskip=0][clfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=藤09a腕b(中)]::
25243::$$$message_0184_0006_0000$$$::"Um, Senpai. Lately, something has felt strange about the town. Could this be..."[lr]::
25244::$$$message_0184_0006_0001$$$::"I told you, it's the same atmosphere as the Holy Grail War. Shirou knows that already."::
25245::$$$message_0184_0007_0000$$$::The strange atmosphere that's been looming over the town for the past few days.[lr]::
25246::$$$message_0184_0007_0001$$$::Saber and Rider's unexplained battle lust.[lr]::
25247::$$$message_0184_0007_0002$$$::None of us know much, and we've all decided to look into it at our own pace.::
25248::$$$message_0184_0008_0000$$$::"Sakura, it's almost time to leave for school."[lr]::
25249::$$$message_0184_0008_0001$$$::"Oh, you're right. Thanks, Rider. I'll clean up soon."[lr]::
25250::$$$message_0184_0008_0002$$$::"No. Shirou and I can handle that. Sakura, you should..."::
25251::$$$message_0184_0009_0000$$$::"I think there's a visitor. I'll go check."[wm canskip=0][lr]::
25252::$$$message_0184_0009_0001$$$::"Don't tell me it's another newspaper salesman. That will be hard for her to handle."::
25253::$$$message_0184_0010_0000$$$::Rider stands up, slowly but threateningly.[lr]::
25254::$$$message_0184_0010_0001$$$::Sounds like the door-to-door salespeople here can be pretty pushy.::
25255::$$$message_0184_0011_0000$$$::"No, you don't need to, Rider. If it's a newspaper salesman, Sakura's got this. She's got a knack of chasing them off. You could even say you'd just be getting in her way."[lr]::
25256::$$$message_0184_0011_0001$$$::"Huh... If you say so, Shirou... Is Sakura good at dealing with such people?"::
25257::$$$message_0184_0012_0000$$$::"Ridiculously good. Like, champion-level. She told me that it's harder if someone she knows is nearby, so don't even go watch her.[lr]::
25258::$$$message_0184_0012_0001$$$::Until she gets back, let's just[wvl][seloop time=4000 storage=se373.wav][line len=2]"::
25259::$$$message_0184_0013_0000$$$::There isn't even enough time to finish my sentence.[lr]::
25260::$$$message_0184_0013_0001$$$::It literally took her thirty seconds.[lr]::
25261::$$$message_0184_0013_0002$$$::Our champ easily chased off the annoying salesman, and[line len=2][lr]::
25262::$$$message_0184_0013_0003$$$::"I'm home. Looks like you all haven't changed."[cacheimage storage=凛私服コート01b(近)][wvs][fg left=608 opacity=0 textoff=0 index=5000 top=11 time=100 storage=凛私服コート01b(近)][lr]::
25263::$$$message_0184_0013_0004$$$::"...Huh?"[rf][wvs][clfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=凛私服コート01b(中)][lr]::
25264::$$$message_0184_0013_0005$$$::...Our champ is back.::
25265::$$$message_0184_0014_0000$$$::"Why'd you freeze?[lr]::
25266::$$$message_0184_0014_0001$$$::...Oh, is there some nasty ghost haunting me?"::
25267::$$$message_0184_0015_0000$$$::"Aw man, I knew I should've gotten myself cleansed before I flew home... That's what I get for being cheap and asking a freshman."[lr]::
25268::$$$message_0184_0015_0001$$$::Rin Tohsaka mutters something ominous.[lr]::
25269::$$$message_0184_0015_0002$$$::The only one behind her is Sakura, looking embarrassed.::
25270::$$$message_0184_0016_0000$$$::"So, what kinda ghost is behind me?[lr]::
25271::$$$message_0184_0016_0001$$$::Is it one of those resentful ones with long, black hair that looks like they like to wander under willows?"[lr]::
25272::$$$message_0184_0016_0002$$$::Does she know what she's saying? This is getting way too tense to be a joke.::
25273::$$$message_0184_0017_0000$$$::"No, Nee-san, there isn't a ghost following you around. I'm the only one behind you."[lr]::
25274::$$$message_0184_0017_0001$$$::"Oh. Good. I felt some really strong emotions there, so I got worried. It was just you, Sakura.[lr]::
25275::$$$message_0184_0017_0002$$$::Sorry, it had nothing to do with ghosts."::
25276::$$$message_0184_0018_0000$$$::"Yes. If I were you, I'd talk to it before it started to hold a grudge. I'd tell it to stop acting so high and mighty, when it only just showed up."::
25277::$$$message_0184_0019_0000$$$::"Hehe. You've sure gotten confident in the last month, Miss Matou."[lr]::
25278::$$$message_0184_0019_0001$$$::"You too, Senpai. Please stop acting like you're the head of the house when you've been gone for a whole month."::
25279::$$$message_0184_0020_0000$$$::"Ahahahahaha," is how the paragons of sisterly love are laughing.[sestop storage=se220.wav time=1000 nowait=true][lr]::
25280::$$$message_0184_0020_0001$$$::...This is terrifying.[lr]::
25281::$$$message_0184_0020_0002$$$::That's the only word I have for it.[lr]::
25282::$$$message_0184_0020_0003$$$::And I'm gonna die.[lr]::
25283::$$$message_0184_0020_0004$$$::The Emiya house turned into hell from the moment they both started talking.[lr]::
25284::$$$message_0184_0020_0005$$$::That's why I told her if she went to London for help, it would bring even greater calamity down on us...!::
25285::$$$message_0184_0021_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
25286::$$$message_0184_0021_0001$$$::But I'm the actual head of the Emiya household.[lr]::
25287::$$$message_0184_0021_0002$$$::I won't give up the battlefield Kiritsugu left me to these she-devils.[lr]::
25288::$$$message_0184_0021_0003$$$::"Uh, I think that's enough, you two."[lr]::
25289::$$$message_0184_0021_0004$$$::Preparing myself for a swift, honorable death, I stand up.::
25290::$$$message_0184_0022_0000$$$::"Yeah, let's stop joking around, Sakura."[lr]::
25291::$$$message_0184_0022_0001$$$::"Yes, I think it was in bad taste."[lr]::
25292::$$$message_0184_0022_0002$$$::The clock ticks.[lr]::
25293::$$$message_0184_0022_0003$$$::I stand up and stretch, my arms floating aimlessly at my sides.::
25294::$$$message_0184_0023_0000$$$::"...What was that all about, anyway?"[lr]::
25295::$$$message_0184_0023_0001$$$::"Nice preemptive strike, right?[lr]::
25296::$$$message_0184_0023_0002$$$::Sakura and I recreated a little prank I picked up abroad."[lr]::
25297::$$$message_0184_0023_0003$$$::"Yes. She asked me to help freak you out when I greeted her at the door."::
25298::$$$message_0184_0024_0000$$$::They look happy.[lr]::
25299::$$$message_0184_0024_0001$$$::I don't quite get them, but these sisters sure do get along.::
25300::$$$message_0184_0025_0000$$$::"...Okay, I got that. I wish you'd pick a better prank, but I'm glad that's all it was.[lr]::
25301::$$$message_0184_0025_0001$$$::That aside, what are you doing here, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
25302::$$$message_0184_0025_0002$$$::Everyone nods.::
25303::$$$message_0184_0026_0000$$$::"Well, you sent up an SOS, didn't you?[lr]::
25304::$$$message_0184_0026_0001$$$::I'm a busy girl. There's no way I'd come back just for fun."[lr]::
25305::$$$message_0184_0026_0002$$$::"An SOS? Who did?"::
25306::$$$message_0184_0027_0000$$$::"You did. You sounded really insistent, [cacheimage storage=桜制服10c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=桜制服10c(中)]asking me to come home as quick as I could."[lr]::
25307::$$$message_0184_0027_0001$$$::"...What are you talking about? You know I wouldn't ask for you unless I was on the verge of death. And even if I die, you still can't have my soul."::
25308::$$$message_0184_0028_0000$$$::"...That's harsh. What do you think I am? Saying I'll take your soul makes me sound like a demon."[lr]::
25309::$$$message_0184_0028_0001$$$::"Yeah, that's right. Remember what you did last summer,[lr]::
25310::$$$message_0184_0028_0002$$$::the disaster you caused at Illya's castle? If that wasn't demonic, then what would you call it?"::
25311::$$$message_0184_0029_0000$$$::"Urgh... I-it was a hard choice I made in an emergency.[lr]::
25312::$$$message_0184_0029_0001$$$::I didn't sacrifice you because I wanted to."::
25313::$$$message_0184_0030_0000$$$::Tohsaka seems sorry after all, so her reply isn't as defiant as I expected.[lr]::
25314::$$$message_0184_0030_0001$$$::Good, good. I almost moved on to my next life, but she seems genuinely contrite.[lr]::
25315::$$$message_0184_0030_0002$$$::   Anyway...::
25316::$$$message_0184_0031_0000$$$::"So, I sent you an SOS I don't remember, and that's why you're back?"[lr]::
25317::$$$message_0184_0031_0001$$$::"That's what I said. I wouldn't come back unless you asked, Emiya."[lr]::
25318::$$$message_0184_0031_0002$$$::"...So you just skipped out on your business in London?"::
25319::$$$message_0184_0032_0000$$$::"Yeah, you got a problem with that!? What else was I supposed to do? When I read your note, I got so curious I couldn't sleep at night![lr]::
25320::$$$message_0184_0032_0001$$$::B-besides, Fuyuki is my jurisdiction. There's nothing wrong with me coming back to check on it!"[lr]::
25321::$$$message_0184_0032_0002$$$::Tohsaka pouts.[lr]::
25322::$$$message_0184_0032_0003$$$::She sets down her luggage and turns to go into the hall.::
25323::$$$message_0184_0033_0000$$$::"Anyway, I'll be staying for a while.[lr]::
25324::$$$message_0184_0033_0001$$$::If you have any questions, come see me in my room tonight. I'm going to be checking out the town during the day."[lr]::
25325::$$$message_0184_0033_0002$$$::And with that, she's running off to the guesthouse without waiting for a response.::
25326::$$$message_0184_0034_0000$$$::"Ahaha. That's how it is, everyone. I think my sister's embarrassed that she came back with unfinished business."[lr]::
25327::$$$message_0184_0034_0001$$$::Saber and Rider nod, still digesting this sudden change.::
25328::$$$message_0184_0035_0000$$$::"...Oh. Now that Rin's back, it'll get solved in no time."[lr]::
25329::$$$message_0184_0035_0001$$$::Illya gazes into the distance, sounding a little sad.::
25330::$$$message_0184_0036_0000$$$::"Uh, um..."[lr]::
25331::$$$message_0184_0036_0001$$$::I feel antsy, not sure if I should be happy or anxious.[lr]::
25332::$$$message_0184_0036_0002$$$::But this does mean we've acquired a missing piece of the puzzle.[lr]::
25333::$$$message_0184_0036_0003$$$::Anyway, Tohsaka's back!::
925277::$$$message_9184_0019_0000$$$::"Hehe. You've sure gotten confident in the last month, Miss Matou."[r]^�NA